      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "The 1972 original revolutionized how science fiction could approach human psychology. Rather than focusing on alien encounters or space exploration, Tarkovsky used the genre to examine human consciousness itself. This influence appears in later works like <a href=\"/movie/27205\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"27205\">Inception</a> (2010) and <a href=\"/movie/376865\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"376865\">High Life</a> (2018), where space and consciousness become intertwined. The film's emphasis on emotional truth over scientific accuracy created a new pathway for philosophical science fiction."
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Tarkovsky's use of color, particularly in the Earth sequences versus the space station, established a visual language that continues to influence filmmakers. <a href=\"/movie/335984\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"335984\">Blade Runner 2049</a> (2017) directly references Solaris's approach to memory and loss, while <a href=\"/movie/419704\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"419704\">Ad Astra</a> (2019) mirrors its focus on psychological isolation in space. The film's treatment of artificial life - through the recreation of Hari - predates similar explorations in <a href=\"/movie/264660\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"264660\">Ex Machina</a> (2014) and <a href=\"/movie/152601\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"152601\">Her</a> (2013). SUBHEAD: Impact on Contemporary Cinema"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Modern filmmakers continue drawing from Solaris's wellspring. <a href=\"/movie/300668\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"300668\">Annihilation</a> (2018) explores similar themes of an alien presence that mirrors human consciousness, while <a href=\"/movie/97370\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"97370\">Under the Skin</a> (2013) adopts its alienating perspective on human interaction. The film's influence extends beyond science fiction - its meditation on grief and loss echoes in works like <a href=\"/movie/428449\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"428449\">A Ghost Story</a> (2017) and <a href=\"/movie/340676\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"340676\">Personal Shopper</a> (2016)."
      }
